<title>POLAND: PBR FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>PBR FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  1.82 vs    3.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    4.38 vs    7.25</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  8.65 vs   11.03</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	16.78 vs   16.90</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.73 vs    7.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    7.54 vs   13.03</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.30 vs   18.14</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	34.28 vs   34.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Polski Bank Rozwoju SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
